    "# ============================================================\n",
    "# CELL 8: Main evaluation loop (6 Models - Bulletproof Version)\n",
    "# Runs models sequentially: load -> evaluate -> unload -> clear GPU -> clear disk\n",
    "# FIXED Issue 2 + 3: each model now has a \"prompt_style\" key so\n",
